      "detail": "Show that PilotFish can apply CMS Medically Unlikely Edits (MUE) as a business-rule layer on X12 837P claims: look up each service line\u2019s CPT/HCPCS against an external MUE table and kick out lines whose units exceed. We'll build that in 2 routes. Starting with a blank canvas on the first route.",
